mergency: true` and must name an owner,\na reason, and an end date; the workflow opens a follow-up review issue.\n\n## Owners\n\n- Accountable party: Northbay Clinic Group, Patient Access (VP Patient Access)\n- Operational owner: agent-platform team, `#agent-platform-oncall`","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01RKWnEeBUkb7FjZRo6SiK7B","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
